        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The chupacabra Strides and makes a Strike at the end of that movement. If the chupacabra began this action hidden, it remains hidden until after this ability's Strike."
      ]
    }
